Deliverable: parser modules with a golden-file test set of real (already redacted) sample lines, including the ugly cases.","priority":9,"complexity":4,"estimatedHours":6,"tags":["ingestion","logs","parsing"]}

{"workingDirectory":"/Users/fanysmacpro/Developer/agents/pe6203-agent-harness-safety/results/raw/reviewed-coverage-pilot-20261101/cells/cell-006/run/workspace","projectId":"91d2db77-2300-4ae4-961a-fea9e69f5ecf","parentId":"d3bf3c47-478d-4a7e-9aa8-95402f5a7f8d","name":"Enforce PII redaction and tokenization at ingest","details":"Implement the redaction rules approved in M1 so sensitive values are removed before data is written anywhere durable - not scrubbed later in the warehouse.

