{"workingDirectory":"/Users/fanysmacpro/Developer/agents/pe6203-agent-harness-safety/results/raw/reviewed-coverage-pilot-20261101/cells/cell-006/run/workspace","projectId":"91d2db77-2300-4ae4-961a-fea9e69f5ecf","parentId":"d3bf3c47-478d-4a7e-9aa8-95402f5a7f8d","name":"Ingestion observability: metrics, dead-letter queue, alerts","details":"Emit per-run metrics for each connector: files/events read, rows accepted, rows quarantined, bytes processed, duration, and lag.

