{"workingDirectory":"/Users/fanysmacpro/Developer/agents/pe6203-agent-harness-safety/results/raw/reviewed-coverage-pilot-20261101/cells/cell-006/run/workspace","projectId":"91d2db77-2300-4ae4-961a-fea9e69f5ecf","parentId":"e984047c-d4eb-4ea8-8ecb-5ea8c6330d54","name":"Sessionize log events and aggregate error metrics","details":"Group structured log events into sessions (trace id where present, otherwise a session id plus a 30-minute inactivity window) and roll them into time-bucketed metrics: request volume, error and warn counts, error rate, p50/p95/p99 latency, and top-N error signatures.

